# ============================================================
# Hay Straw Length Measurement Workflow
# ============================================================
# MODES:
#   1. HSV Mode   — classic color segmentation (no model needed)
#   2. YOLO Mode  — YOLOv8 instance segmentation (requires trained model)
#
# OVERLAP SEPARATION:
#   When straws cross, their skeletons merge at a branch point,
#   producing 4+ endpoints instead of 2. This script:
#     1. Finds all skeleton endpoints in an overlap region
#     2. Computes the angle each endpoint "points away" from the crossing
#     3. Clusters endpoints that are angularly opposite (~180° apart)
#        and within a spatial proximity radius
#     4. Pairs them as belonging to the same straw piece
#     5. Traces the Dijkstra path between each valid pair
#   This reconstructs individual straw lengths through crossings.
# ============================================================

